{"id":"3363f2782f9bc6a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-brun.md","title":"Brun's Theorem","display":"thm-brun — Brun's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-brun","aliases":["58-thm-brun"],"display":"thm-brun — Brun's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-twin-prime]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[58-df-prime-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-brun"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-brun</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-brun — Brun's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e88eaec4442b96a\" href=\"?note=3e88eaec4442b96a\" title=\"58-df-twin-prime\">58-df-twin-prime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"58-df-prime-number\">58-df-prime-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_2\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(B_2\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (Brun's constant)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brun}\\vdash\nB_2\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p+2)}}\n\\left(\\frac1p+\\frac1{p+2}\\right)\n&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brun}\\vdash\nB_2\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p+2)}}\n\\left(\\frac1p+\\frac1{p+2}\\right)\n&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Brun's sieve gives upper bound on twin prime sum.</li>\n<li>Numerically, Brun's constant is approximately <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1.90216\\ldots\">\\(1.90216\\ldots\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Brun: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2(x) &lt; Cx / (\\log x)^2\">\\(\\pi_2(x) &lt; Cx / (\\log x)^2\\)</span> for twin primes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_2(x)\">\\(\\pi_2(x)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Brun's constant is the convergent sum of the reciprocals of both members of every twin-prime pair.</li>\n<li>Newman's simplification: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{p, p+2} 1/p &lt; \\infty\">\\(\\sum_{p, p+2} 1/p &lt; \\infty\\)</span> by analytic methods.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-twin-prime","status":"resolved","id":"3e88eaec4442b96a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-twin-prime]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-prime-number","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-prime-number]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B_2\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brun}\\vdash\nB_2\\coloneqq\n\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n\\operatorname{Prime}(p)\\land\\operatorname{Prime}(p+2)}}\n\\left(\\frac1p+\\frac1{p+2}\\right)\n<\\infty.","display":true},{"tex":"1.90216\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_2(x) < Cx / (\\log x)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_2(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{p, p+2} 1/p < \\infty","display":false}],"bytes":982,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4062","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-brun.md|58-thm-brun]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["3e88eaec4442b96a","3322615e4eea05e9","dad686059f3ca152"]}